  <div data-dc-tpl="24" style="max-width: 720px; margin: 0px auto; padding: clamp(48px, 6vw, 80px) clamp(20px, 5vw, 40px) clamp(32px, 4vw, 48px);">
    <p data-dc-tpl="25" style="font-family: Newsreader, serif; font-size: clamp(20px, 2.2vw, 24px); line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(42, 35, 29); margin-bottom: 30px;">Talent is everywhere. Opportunity is not. Innovative Global Impact was founded on the gap between those two facts — and on the belief that it can be closed.</p>

    <p data-dc-tpl="26" style="font-size: 17.5px; line-height: 1.72; color: rgb(58, 52, 44); margin-bottom: 22px;">Across the world, capable people are excluded from economic opportunity not for lack of ability, but for lack of access — to education, to capital, to markets. Too often the response is short-term relief that meets an urgent need and then ends, leaving the underlying problem exactly where it was.</p>
    <p data-dc-tpl="27" style="font-size: 17.5px; line-height: 1.72; color: rgb(58, 52, 44); margin-bottom: 36px;">We started IGI to do the other thing: to build the systems that let people generate income, develop local leadership, and sustain their own growth over time.</p>

    <h2 data-dc-tpl="28" data-rev="" style="font-family: Newsreader, serif; font-weight: 500; font-size: clamp(24px, 2.8vw, 32px); line-height: 1.16; color: rgb(36, 28, 23); margin: 14px 0px 16px;">Capacity, not handouts</h2>
    <p data-dc-tpl="29" style="font-size: 17.5px; line-height: 1.72; color: rgb(58, 52, 44); margin-bottom: 22px;">Our work is built to transfer capacity rather than deliver aid. Each program is designed around dignity, ownership, and accountability — grounded in local needs, run by local people, and built to be measured honestly. And each is designed to be repeatable, so a model that works in one place can travel to the next.</p>

    <blockquote data-dc-tpl="30" data-rev="" style="margin: 40px 0px; padding-left: 24px; border-left: 3px solid rgb(36, 28, 23);">
