    <h2 data-dc-tpl="32" data-rev="" style="font-family: Newsreader, serif; font-weight: 500; font-size: clamp(24px, 2.8vw, 32px); line-height: 1.16; color: rgb(36, 28, 23); margin: 14px 0px 16px;">Starting where it's hardest</h2>
    <p data-dc-tpl="33" style="font-size: 17.5px; line-height: 1.72; color: rgb(58, 52, 44); margin-bottom: 22px;">Our name points outward — global impact — and our mission spans many regions. But we're starting in some of Afghanistan's most overlooked provinces, with three flagship pilots in water, newborn survival, and women's livelihoods. If a model can prove itself there, it can prove itself anywhere.</p>
    <p data-dc-tpl="34" style="font-size: 17.5px; line-height: 1.72; color: rgb(58, 52, 44); margin-bottom: 8px;">This is the beginning. We'll share each step here as the work grows — and we'd be glad to have you follow along.</p>
